== Notes ==
* {{i|Dad's Key}}, {{p|Get out of Jail Free Card}}, {{i|Mr. ME!}}, and {{i|Sharp Key}} open Dice Rooms in one use.
* Due to how Dice Room generation works, a floor cannot have both a Dice Room and {{r|Sacrifice Room}}; they are mutually exclusive.
* If a floor has two special rooms that require two keys to enter, the one closer to the start room will be a {{R|Vault}}, and the one further away from it will be a Dice Room.
* It is possible to re-roll a floor into another that has a 5-pip Dice Room. Getting a 5-pip dice room in {{s|Womb}} / {{s|Utero}} II can allow the player to defeat {{e|Mom's Heart}} (or {{E|It Lives!}}) multiple times in one run. This can be used to quickly gain progress tied to the number of Mom's Heart kills.
* It is possible to unlock {{C|Samson}} by finishing the first floor and using a 5-pip Dice Room.
* A 5-pip dice room on an XL floor sends Isaac to the first floor of the chapter.
* When shop pickups are re-rolled via a 3- or 6-pip room, the original prices will remain in place.
* 3- or 6-pip Dice Rooms can reroll chests in Challenge Rooms or Boss Challenge Rooms into collectibles. And since those rooms detect whether a chest is open or an item picked up, there won't be any monsters.
* 3-pip room can re-roll shop pickups into items.
** Using items such as {{I|The D6}} in the room without buying the item can cause the item to revert to a pickup.
* There is a small chance that 1- and 6-pip rooms will not reroll every item Isaac has in his possession.
* {{dlc|a}} Dice Rooms don't re-roll starter challenge items or remove blindfold on challenges.
* {{dlc|a+}} Dice Rooms have a small marker indicating the effect that will be activated when the room is used. This was inspired by [http://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=835149267 this Steam Workshop mod] by Wofsauge.
* {{dlc+|r}} If {{c|Jacob and Esau}} activate a 6-pip room, the items held by both characters will be rerolled, but only the items of the character that step on a 1-pip room will be rerolled.{{dlc-}}
* {{dlc+|r}} Any rooms generated by {{I|Red Key}} that contain an item pedestal will not be affected by a 4-pip room.{{dlc-}}
* {{dlc|r}} In the [[Mirrored World]], the second Dice Room may be different.
* {{dlc+|r}} If {{c|Tainted Lazarus}} activates a 1-pip room, only the state that activated the room will have the items rerolled, leaving the other form's items untouched.{{dlc-}}

